This repository builds container images that bundle EPICS base, synApps,
and areaDetector software. Those components are distributed under their own
licenses (e.g. the EPICS Open License and the individual module licenses);
this license applies to the epics-docker recipes, scripts, and documentation
in this repository, not to the bundled upstream software.
